        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "body",
          "value": {
            "markup": "<p>The integration of Model-Context Protocol (MCP) with Umbraco creates powerful opportunities for content automation and intelligent workflows. By combining Umbraco's flexible content modeling with MCP's standardized communication protocol, teams can build systems that are both powerful and maintainable.</p><p><strong>Practical benefits in real-world scenarios:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Automated content workflows:</strong> MCP enables automatic content synchronization across multiple channels</li><li><strong>Intelligent asset management:</strong> Connect media management to external tools seamlessly</li><li><strong>Content enrichment:</strong> Automatically enhance content with data from third-party services</li><li><strong>Scalable publishing:</strong> Distribute content across multiple platforms without custom code</li><li><strong>Real-time collaboration:</strong> Teams can work across different systems without integration delays</li></ul><p>When you combine Umbraco's robust content management capabilities with MCP's protocol-driven approach, you unlock new possibilities for how organizations manage and distribute content at scale.</p>",
            "blocks": {
